+# Proof outline
+
+The frozen statement asserts that the rank-3 exceptional subgroup attached to
+the `(3,3)` permutation-product case is not generated by any two elements.
+The claim-owned proof surface carries the proposition through an explicit
+finite transport witness, while the exact provider module and qualified
+declaration remain recorded in each Lean artifact's provenance comment.
+
+The composition DAG is:
+
+1. `source-record`: frozen declaration and source-file digest.
+2. `semantic-environment`: provider/revision and transitive-constant census.
+3. `transport-forward`: statement transport.
+4. `transport-backward`: proof transport.
+5. `audit-replay`: independent audit anchor and cold replay receipt.
+
+Every edge is typed, content addressed, and represented in the machine and
+readability ledgers.
